</section><div class="bg-white pt-5">
  <div class="container text-center mw-800">
    <h2 class="heading-border-offset-center"><span>Let us help you pay for college</span></h2>
    <p>It costs less than you might think. Pellissippi State offers all the advantages of a four-year college education - top faculty, a wide range of courses and degree options - all at less than half the cost. We can help you find options to make your education affordable.</p>
    <div class="d-grid gap-2">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-4">
  <a href="/student-accounts/tuition-fees/#" class="btn btn-primary mt-2 mb-2">Tuition &amp; Fees</a>
</div>
        <div class="col-lg-4">
  <a href="/financialaid/scholarships/#" class="btn btn-primary mt-2 mb-2">Scholarships</a>
</div>
        <div class="col-lg-4">
  <a href="/financialaid/#" class="btn btn-primary mt-2 mb-2">Financial Aid</a>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="https://www.tbr.edu/initiatives/tn-promise" class="ms-4 me-4 mt-4 d-inline-block">Tennessee Promise</a>
      <a href="https://tnreconnect.gov/" class="ms-4 me-4 mt-4 d-inline-block">Tennessee Reconnect</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div><span id="d.en.12978"></span>
<section class="darkblue-bg pt-5 pb-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="h1 text-white text-center mb-5">Our Campuses</h2>
    <ul class="our-campuses-cards-wrapper">
      
      <li class="our-campuses-card clickable-div">
  <div class='card-image'>
    <img alt='Blount homepage' src='/media/pstccedu/site-assets/images/Blount-main.jpg'>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="card-title"><a href="/campus/blount-county/#">Blount County Campus</a></div>
    <p class='card-content'>Located in Friendsville at the foothills of the Great Smoky Mountains National Park, this campus is home to an apiary and a research vineyard as well as our award winning Culinary Institute.</p>
  </div>
</li>
      
      <li class="our-campuses-card clickable-div">
  <div class='card-image'>
    <img alt='Hardin homepage' src='/media/pstccedu/site-assets/images/HardinVelley-main.jpg'>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="card-title"><a href="/campus/hardin-valley/#">Hardin Valley Campus</a></div>
    <p class='card-content'>Our largest campus, at 144 acres, has a walking trail and disc golf course as well as the Student Recreation Center, the Bagwell Center for Media and Art and the Clayton Performing Arts Center.</p>
  </div>
</li>
      
      <li class="our-campuses-card clickable-div">
  <div class='card-image'>
    <img alt='Pellissippi State Magnolia Ave Campus Entrance' src='/media/pstccedu/site-assets/images/Magnolia-Entrance-2017-2.jpg'>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="card-title"><a href="/campus/magnolia/#">Magnolia Avenue Campus</a></div>
    <p class='card-content'>The Magnolia Avenue Campus is easily accessible by car or public transportation &ndash; or  even by foot for residents of downtown Knoxville and surrounding areas. </p>
  </div>
</li>
      
      <li class="our-campuses-card clickable-div">
  <div class='card-image'>
    <img alt='Strawberry homepage' src='/media/pstccedu/site-assets/images/StrawberryPlains-main.jpg'>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="card-title"><a href="/campus/strawberry-plains/#">Strawberry Plains Campus</a></div>
    <p class='card-content'>Situated in the eastern portion of Knox County, this campus houses the college's welding, nursing and cyber-defense programs and is also home to the Appalachian Heritage Project.</p>
  </div>
</li>
      
      
      
    </ul>
  </div>
